      "writtenOn": "2017-04-06T18:39:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think you need to do the immediate reset to maintain previous behavior. i.e. if (td-\u003eupstart_mode) then do VENDOR_CC_IMMEDIATE_RESET.\n\nThat\u0027s how the updates worked through .18 and probably should continue that way. The reason is that we\u0027ll be resetting the x86 systems when they go into s3 since pltrst_l will assert in s3. We don\u0027t want that.",
      "revId": "17be75f3c91e0d3e85fbe9f74728955e5cfe643c",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "d93e4e85_6d10efc1",
