      "writtenOn": "2017-04-06T20:26:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Up to 0.0.19 we always posted a reboot. We did not reboot immediately. We relied on cr50-result rebooting the device after cr50-update finished running.\n\nI think that we will just need to have 0.0.19 out before we try and to transition away from cr50-update. Or the new background update script should reboot after the cr50 update if it is an old image.",
      "parentUuid": "7075ce4c_6fd769e1",
      "revId": "17be75f3c91e0d3e85fbe9f74728955e5cfe643c",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
